00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:33.700
In games on the NES so far, we've mostly seen that, like, the teams are the teams and they're really just there for, like, flair.

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:39.760
They all have, like, somewhat reasonable, like, players that, you know, like, this guy excels in base running.

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:40.920
This guy excels in hitting.

