00:20:04.020 --> 00:20:08.300
Like, Italy just puts together a bad team, you know, like, on paper.

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:13.120
It's like, they just don't have the same hitting power as New York does.

00:20:13.840 --> 00:20:21.060
That's right. Um, but, but, you know, that, I think that's a, that's a good accessibility replayability thing, too.

00:20:21.240 --> 00:20:22.560
Is, like, you know, it's a nice challenge.

00:20:22.560 --> 00:20:26.080
It's like, I'm gonna, um, I'm gonna win the championship.

